// metalwork, jewellery, jade, lacquer, arms...) marked CC0, with a web image, put in cultures by their culture field and date (an Egyptian
// piece before 400 CE, a Greek one before 30 BCE...), those with the most exhibitions and citations of each, fragments, beads, coins,
// sketches and a second of the same thing left out. Twelve a culture at first; on 24 Nov 2026 (Korbi: "more art for spyglass") up to twenty,
// a few of them paintings in the cultures that painted on silk and paper, and Tibet and the Ottoman Empire added. The museum waives every
